WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Zana · Your first project in 30 seconds

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Everything starts in a project — a project is just a folder

2
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.100
Add your first project — pick any folder on your Mac

3
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.900
Pick any agent you like — Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Pi…

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:24.100
Ask for a design first — agents write and read your design docs

5
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.700
Then let it build — preview right in the side panel

6
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.500
Zana tells you when it’s done — reports land in your Inbox

7
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Your turn — add a folder and ask an agent
